Explanation: Accept updates within the proprietary Ubuntu desktop R580 driver branch.
Package: nvidia-driver-580 nvidia-dkms-580
Pin: version 580.*
Pin-Priority: 990

Explanation: Reject other NVIDIA driver/DKMS branches or flavours and transitional versions.
Package: /^nvidia-(driver|dkms)-[0-9]+(-server)?(-open)?$/
Pin: version /^.+$/
Pin-Priority: -1
